@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "Customer / Staff" as User
participant "AccountPage / StaffPage" as UI
participant "App.jsx" as App
participant "BookingController" as Controller
participant "BookingWorkflowService" as Service
participant "BookingServiceItemRepository / InvoiceRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

== UC-21: Update extra services before check-in ==

User -> UI : 1. Increase, reduce or remove booked services
activate User
activate UI

UI -> App : 2. updateBookingServices(services, bookingId)
activate App

App -> App : 3. Validate UI state and build request
activate App
deactivate App

App -> Controller : 4. PUT /api/bookings/{bookingId}/services
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. updateBookingServices(bookingId, request)
activate Service

Service -> Service : 6. Only pending/confirmed before booked start;\nrecheck visibility, quantity and overlapping stock
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
  Service -> Repo : 7. delete/save service items; find/save invoice
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 8. REPLACE booking_service; UPSERT invoice
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 9. Services and invoice
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Service : 10. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 11. Recalculate discounts, remaining and refundable
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    Invalid lifecycle or stock -> HTTP 400
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 12. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 13. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> App : 14. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

App -> App : 15. setSelectedBookingDetail(response.data)
activate App
deactivate App

App --> UI : 16. Show revised invoice balance/refund
deactivate App

UI --> User : 17. Updated screen or error feedback

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
